[03:31.19-03:34.56]So I don't have to say you were<br><small class="es">Para no tener que decir que fuiste</small><br><span class="pron">/soʊ aɪ doʊnt hæv tuː seɪ juː wɜːr/</span><br><span class="note"><b>Outro:</b> Desaceleración del tempo vocal.</span>
